# Clockwork — SOPS-encrypted secrets
# This file is managed by SOPS; encrypt with:
#   sops --encrypt secrets.env > secrets.env
# Decrypt with:
#   sops --decrypt secrets.env > secrets.env.decrypted
#
# Values are encrypted per-key. Store this file in version control;
# the decryption key lives in the deploy environment.
#
# Example structure (values shown encrypted):
# CLOCKWORK_TOKEN=ENC[AES256_GCM,...]
# CLOCKWORK_NOTIFY_TOKEN=ENC[AES256_GCM,...]
# CLOCKWORK_GIT_TOKEN=ENC[AES256_GCM,...]
